        a: 'Schema evolution is when the source data structure changes — new columns added, columns removed, types changed. Handle with: Delta Lake schema evolution (mergeSchema), Avro/Protobuf schema registries for Kafka, dbt source freshness tests, and alerting on unexpected schema changes.',
