        detailedAnswer: '`OPTIMIZE table ZORDER BY (customer_id, event_date)` — files are rewritten so rows with the same customer_id are in the same files. This enables data skipping: if you query `WHERE customer_id = 123`, Delta reads only the files that contain that value. Liquid Clustering (Databricks Runtime 13+) provides automatic, incremental clustering without full rewrites.',
